  "comment": "What Coinshift's app and its pack use of the node's app RPC (doc/app.md): the app's whitelist at the node, the pack's manifest for the unified wallet. Checked against the node's own (AppLayer::manifest) by the tests. The node is coinshift-rs' drop-in `coinshift`, its data folder LayerTwo's <data_dir>/coinshift, one RPC server (--rpc-addr).",
